{"root":{"children":[{"children":[{"detail":0,"format":0,"mode":"normal","style":"","text":"是你斤斤计较了，这是确定的。","type":"text","version":1}],"direction":null,"format":"","indent":0,"type":"paragraph","version":1,"textFormat":0,"textStyle":""},{"children":[{"detail":0,"format":0,"mode":"normal","style":"","text":"你连打印纸、墨盒都算到了，这还不算斤斤计较吗？","type":"text","version":1}],"direction":null,"format":"","indent":0,"type":"paragraph","version":1,"textFormat":0,"textStyle":""},{"children":[{"detail":0,"format":0,"mode":"normal","style":"","text":"至于哥嫂是不是装傻充愣，我们根据你的一面之词说来说去只能是猜，没办法下什么结论。","type":"text","version":1}],"direction":null,"format":"","indent":0,"type":"paragraph","version":1,"textFormat":0,"textStyle":""},{"children":[{"detail":0,"format":0,"mode":"normal","style":"","text":"他们可能确实在装傻占你便宜，也可能仅仅是觉得这是正常的人情往来，只是凑巧出现了你比较吃亏的状态——你怎么知道过几年你结婚生子、而哥嫂孩子已经成年后哥嫂不会连续的给你红包呢？

但你别紧张，因为斤斤计较并没有什么错，人有权利斤斤计较，也没有办法不斤斤计较。","type":"text","version":1}],"direction":null,"format":"","indent":0,"type":"paragraph","version":1,"textFormat":0,"textStyle":""},{"children":[{"detail":0,"format":0,"mode":"normal","style":"","text":"你确实经济比较困难，在情感上也确实没办法接受这样一直付出，你就是情绪上难受了、心理上承受不住了，这没什么好羞耻的。","type":"text","version":1}],"direction":null,"format":"","indent":0,"type":"paragraph","version":1,"textFormat":0,"textStyle":""},{"children":[{"detail":0,"format":0,"mode":"normal","style":"","text":"接受这个事实，承认这个事实。

大胆的告诉ta们你的承受力有限，只能聊表心意，做不到太大的金额。","type":"text","version":1}],"direction":null,"format":"","indent":0,"type":"paragraph","version":1,"textFormat":0,"textStyle":""},{"children":[{"detail":0,"format":0,"mode":"normal","style":"","text":"ta们明确的知道了，结果好就是好，不好就是不好，你不要为此悔恨自己的坦白。","type":"text","version":1}],"direction":null,"format":"","indent":0,"type":"paragraph","version":1,"textFormat":0,"textStyle":""},{"children":[{"detail":0,"format":0,"mode":"normal","style":"","text":"因为你最终不能走这种“奋力维持一个自己实际做不到的好表现以得到超额回报”的路线。","type":"text","version":1}],"direction":null,"format":"","indent":0,"type":"paragraph","version":1,"textFormat":0,"textStyle":""},{"children":[{"detail":0,"format":0,"mode":"normal","style":"","text":"你其实是卡在这个总体战略上了。","type":"text","version":1}],"direction":null,"format":"","indent":0,"type":"paragraph","version":1,"textFormat":0,"textStyle":""},{"children":[{"detail":0,"format":0,"mode":"normal","style":"","text":"今天在哥嫂面前维持一个自己做不到的慷慨大方水平，明天在朋友面前维持一个自己做不到的两肋插刀水平，后天在上司面前维持一个其实做不到的敬业爱岗水平……这个策略应用的范围越广，你就会越筋疲力竭。","type":"text","version":1}],"direction":null,"format":"","indent":0,"type":"paragraph","version":1,"textFormat":0,"textStyle":""},{"children":[{"detail":0,"format":0,"mode":"normal","style":"","text":"最后圈子绷得太大，你要全面支撑会越开越难。然而这些泡沫化的领域往往是互相关联的，就像经济问题一样，一个崩溃很容易引发连环崩溃。","type":"text","version":1}],"direction":null,"format":"","indent":0,"type":"paragraph","version":1,"textFormat":0,"textStyle":""},{"children":[{"detail":0,"format":0,"mode":"normal","style":"","text":"不是不能适当泡沫化，但一定要防止全面泡沫化。持续泡沫化。","type":"text","version":1}],"direction":null,"format":"","indent":0,"type":"paragraph","version":1,"textFormat":0,"textStyle":""},{"children":[{"detail":0,"format":0,"mode":"normal","style":"","text":"这就意味着你平时就要经常的，定期地自我去泡沫。","type":"text","version":1}],"direction":null,"format":"","indent":0,"type":"paragraph","version":1,"textFormat":0,"textStyle":""},{"children":[{"detail":0,"format":0,"mode":"normal","style":"","text":"不要在所有方向上都贪图超额利润，这个部分应该专门安排在你的对外商业项目上——严格意义上讲，不是要在这些方向维持泡沫化形象，而是要调动主要资源，维持尽可能高的交付标准和稳定性，以保持自己信誉，经营自己的品牌。","type":"text","version":1}],"direction":null,"format":"","indent":0,"type":"paragraph","version":1,"textFormat":0,"textStyle":""},{"children":[{"detail":0,"format":0,"mode":"normal","style":"","text":"而你如果在所有的战线、所有的关系上都维持泡沫化的经营，你的资源必然分散，精力也不能集中，最后其实是要影响你的外部收入的。","type":"text","version":1}],"direction":null,"format":"","indent":0,"type":"paragraph","version":1,"textFormat":0,"textStyle":""},{"children":[{"detail":0,"format":0,"mode":"normal","style":"","text":"而你从整个家族外获取的收入，其实在本质上决定着你的家族地位。","type":"text","version":1}],"direction":null,"format":"","indent":0,"type":"paragraph","version":1,"textFormat":0,"textStyle":""},{"children":[{"detail":0,"format":0,"mode":"normal","style":"","text":"你要定期的对人们说说坦白话，去去泡沫，挤挤水分，避免维持太高的期待。","type":"text","version":1}],"direction":null,"format":"","indent":0,"type":"paragraph","version":1,"textFormat":0,"textStyle":""},{"children":[{"detail":0,"format":0,"mode":"normal","style":"","text":"你只是要温柔的说，抱歉的说。","type":"text","version":1}],"direction":null,"format":"","indent":0,"type":"paragraph","version":1,"textFormat":0,"textStyle":""},{"children":[{"detail":0,"format":0,"mode":"normal","style":"","text":"这不是对方的错，而是自己能力不够，暂时承担不起，对方没有绝对的义务要察觉你的个人情况，本来就需要你来主动报告的。","type":"text","version":1}],"direction":null,"format":"","indent":0,"type":"paragraph","version":1,"textFormat":0,"textStyle":""},{"children":[{"detail":0,"format":0,"mode":"normal","style":"","text":"你主动报告了，对方却不肯降低要求，那再另当别论了。","type":"text","version":1}],"direction":null,"format":"","indent":0,"type":"paragraph","version":1,"textFormat":0,"textStyle":""}],"direction":null,"format":"","indent":0,"type":"root","version":1}}

{"root":{"children":[{"children":[{"detail":0,"format":0,"mode":"normal","style":"","text":"每天都在和拖延较劲，道理懂了一箩筐：知道“先完成再完善”比追求完美更重要，也清楚“行动起来就能缓解焦虑”，可真到了要做事的时候，还是会下意识地摸手机、刷视频，或者对着任务发呆，哪怕只是一件半小时就能搞定的小事，也能磨蹭大半天。

试过番茄钟、列清单，但往往卡在“按下开始键”的那一刻——总觉得“还没准备好”，总想着“再等一会儿状态更好”，结果越等越慌，越慌越不想动，最后 deadline 逼近，只能熬夜赶工，质量差不说，还特别消耗心力。

想问下各位过来人，有没有那种不用靠意志力硬扛、低成本、易操作的“启动小技巧”？比如不用准备复杂工具，随手就能开始的那种，能帮我打破“想做却迟迟不行动”的死循环。","type":"text","version":1}],"direction":null,"format":"","indent":0,"type":"quote","version":1},{"children":[{"detail":0,"format":0,"mode":"normal","style":"","text":"这个技巧说穿了一钱不值，但是你试一试就有奇效。","type":"text","version":1}],"direction":null,"format":"","indent":0,"type":"paragraph","version":1,"textFormat":0,"textStyle":""},{"children":[{"detail":0,"format":0,"mode":"normal","style":"","text":"那就是为开始做好一切准备——笔放好，参考书放好，格子打好，椅子摆好，界面调好……","type":"text","version":1}],"direction":null,"format":"","indent":0,"type":"paragraph","version":1,"textFormat":0,"textStyle":""},{"children":[{"detail":0,"format":0,"mode":"normal","style":"","text":"第一步要做什么，第二步要做什么的指南都写好，摆好。","type":"text","version":1}],"direction":null,"format":"","indent":0,"type":"paragraph","version":1,"textFormat":0,"textStyle":""},{"children":[{"detail":0,"format":0,"mode":"normal","style":"","text":"你想得到什么准备，你就做什么准备。","type":"text","version":1}],"direction":null,"format":"","indent":0,"type":"paragraph","version":1,"textFormat":0,"textStyle":""},{"children":[{"detail":0,"format":0,"mode":"normal","style":"","text":"一直做到万事俱备，只欠东风。","type":"text","version":1}],"direction":null,"format":"","indent":0,"type":"paragraph","version":1,"textFormat":0,"textStyle":""},{"children":[{"detail":0,"format":0,"mode":"normal","style":"","text":"然后去睡觉。","type":"text","version":1}],"direction":null,"format":"","indent":0,"type":"paragraph","version":1,"textFormat":0,"textStyle":""},{"children":[{"detail":0,"format":0,"mode":"normal","style":"","text":"想睡多久睡多久。","type":"text","version":1}],"direction":null,"format":"","indent":0,"type":"paragraph","version":1,"textFormat":0,"textStyle":""},{"children":[{"detail":0,"format":0,"mode":"normal","style":"","text":"然后，睡醒之后的第一件事——注意是睁眼之后的第一件事，最多放在尿尿、便便之后——就是坐下来，开工。","type":"text","version":1}],"direction":null,"format":"","indent":0,"type":"paragraph","version":1,"textFormat":0,"textStyle":""},{"children":[{"detail":0,"format":0,"mode":"normal","style":"","text":"别吃饭、别搞什么早锻炼、别先刷十分钟短视频、别打开知乎看我更新了什么，甚至不要刷牙、洗脸。","type":"text","version":1}],"direction":null,"format":"","indent":0,"type":"paragraph","version":1,"textFormat":0,"textStyle":""},{"children":[{"detail":0,"format":0,"mode":"normal","style":"","text":"立刻开始、第一时间开始。","type":"text","version":1}],"direction":null,"format":"","indent":0,"type":"paragraph","version":1,"textFormat":0,"textStyle":""},{"children":[{"detail":0,"format":0,"mode":"normal","style":"","text":"你不应该需要去找水喝，因为你桌上应该有水，那应该是你准备的一部分。","type":"text","version":1}],"direction":null,"format":"","indent":0,"type":"paragraph","version":1,"textFormat":0,"textStyle":""},{"children":[{"detail":0,"format":0,"mode":"normal","style":"","text":"你不应该干到二十分钟突然有朋友来玩，因为“告诉朋友没时间”应该是你准备的一部分。","type":"text","version":1}],"direction":null,"format":"","indent":0,"type":"paragraph","version":1,"textFormat":0,"textStyle":""},{"children":[{"detail":0,"format":0,"mode":"normal","style":"","text":"再说一遍——做好一切你能做好的准备，但不要开始，而是去睡觉。睡醒后，第一时间开始。","type":"text","version":1}],"direction":null,"format":"","indent":0,"type":"paragraph","version":1,"textFormat":0,"textStyle":""},{"children":[{"detail":0,"format":0,"mode":"normal","style":"","text":"你就想象自己是要出家，睡觉就是要剃光头了，有任何红尘未了之愿，剃头之前了个干净。剃完头，开口第一句就是“阿弥陀佛”了。","type":"text","version":1}],"direction":null,"format":"","indent":0,"type":"paragraph","version":1,"textFormat":0,"textStyle":""},{"children":[{"detail":0,"format":0,"mode":"normal","style":"","text":"然后一心向佛，勇往直前，闷着头往前冲。","type":"text","version":1}],"direction":null,"format":"","indent":0,"type":"paragraph","version":1,"textFormat":0,"textStyle":""},{"children":[{"detail":0,"format":0,"mode":"normal","style":"","text":"直到你筋疲力竭，饿了要吃饭了，困了要睡觉了。","type":"text","version":1}],"direction":null,"format":"","indent":0,"type":"paragraph","version":1,"textFormat":0,"textStyle":""},{"children":[{"detail":0,"format":0,"mode":"normal","style":"","text":"你就退出。吃饭。然后再开始做完全的准备。","type":"text","version":1}],"direction":null,"format":"","indent":0,"type":"paragraph","version":1,"textFormat":0,"textStyle":""},{"children":[{"detail":0,"format":0,"mode":"normal","style":"","text":"把这次突击中扯你后腿的东西放进你这次的准备中去，这次不但万全，而且是一万零一全。","type":"text","version":1}],"direction":null,"format":"","indent":0,"type":"paragraph","version":1,"textFormat":0,"textStyle":""},{"children":[{"detail":0,"format":0,"mode":"normal","style":"","text":"如果你要玩游戏过过瘾，那就去过，视为下一次开战的准备之一。","type":"text","version":1}],"direction":null,"format":"","indent":0,"type":"paragraph","version":1,"textFormat":0,"textStyle":""},{"children":[{"detail":0,"format":0,"mode":"normal","style":"","text":"然后再来一次——睡觉，睡醒后第一件事就是开工，接着那个一万零一全的准备开工。","type":"text","version":1}],"direction":null,"format":"","indent":0,"type":"paragraph","version":1,"textFormat":0,"textStyle":""},{"children":[{"detail":0,"format":0,"mode":"normal","style":"","text":"再勇往直前，直到三鼓而竭，鸣金收兵，再去做一万零二全的准备。还是那句话——只准备，不开工。凡属于开工的事，一件也不做，坚决留到睡醒后的第一时间去做。你干脆写下来，摆在准备好的桌面上——“第一步，做xxxx”。","type":"text","version":1}],"direction":null,"format":"","indent":0,"type":"paragraph","version":1,"textFormat":0,"textStyle":""},{"children":[{"detail":0,"format":0,"mode":"normal","style":"","text":"然后我们解释一下这个策略的原理。","type":"text","version":1}],"direction":null,"format":"","indent":0,"type":"paragraph","version":1,"textFormat":0,"textStyle":""},{"children":[{"detail":0,"format":0,"mode":"normal","style":"","text":"准备工作本身是没有压力的，而且为工作做好铺垫和准备，本身是很有乐趣的事。这就像开战之前修工事的民工，知道自己不会上战场，反而会特别喜欢修工事，好奇自己的战壕怎么挖最防炸、敌人冲进来怎么最有利于自己反击。","type":"text","version":1}],"direction":null,"format":"","indent":0,"type":"paragraph","version":1,"textFormat":0,"textStyle":""},{"children":[{"detail":0,"format":0,"mode":"normal","style":"","text":"修防线的工程师不必上战场，只顾堆积自己的奇思妙想。堆积得越多，反而越盼着敌人早日袭来，想要看看自己设计的巧妙工事发挥威力。","type":"text","version":1}],"direction":null,"format":"","indent":0,"type":"paragraph","version":1,"textFormat":0,"textStyle":""},{"children":[{"detail":0,"format":0,"mode":"normal","style":"","text":"你这时被“睡醒之后才会开战”的安全感完全保护着，自然不焦虑。","type":"text","version":1}],"direction":null,"format":"","indent":0,"type":"paragraph","version":1,"textFormat":0,"textStyle":""},{"children":[{"detail":0,"format":0,"mode":"normal","style":"","text":"而等你修好强大工事，你睡一觉醒来，化身战士进入战壕开战时，被钢筋混凝土保护着，从容屠杀抢滩敌人的快感自然会托住你，让你越战越勇。","type":"text","version":1}],"direction":null,"format":"","indent":0,"type":"paragraph","version":1,"textFormat":0,"textStyle":""},{"children":[{"detail":0,"format":0,"mode":"normal","style":"","text":"万全的准备自然不是白费的，你打起来顺手，自然就会兴奋，兴奋了，打起来就更顺手，这是一个自持的过程。","type":"text","version":1}],"direction":null,"format":"","indent":0,"type":"paragraph","version":1,"textFormat":0,"textStyle":""},{"children":[{"detail":0,"format":0,"mode":"normal","style":"","text":"你很容易就废寝忘食。","type":"text","version":1}],"direction":null,"format":"","indent":0,"type":"paragraph","version":1,"textFormat":0,"textStyle":""},{"children":[{"detail":0,"format":0,"mode":"normal","style":"","text":"只要没有卡住，没有饥饿、困倦，就继续往前跑；卡住了、饥饿、疲劳了，就视为这一仗打完了。","type":"text","version":1}],"direction":null,"format":"","indent":0,"type":"paragraph","version":1,"textFormat":0,"textStyle":""},{"children":[{"detail":0,"format":0,"mode":"normal","style":"","text":"精力转向准备下一战。","type":"text","version":1}],"direction":null,"format":"","indent":0,"type":"paragraph","version":1,"textFormat":0,"textStyle":""},{"children":[{"detail":0,"format":0,"mode":"normal","style":"","text":"每一战都不是无把握之战，你都是在自己造好的工事里，在自己最好的状态下开战，而且打到尽兴而止。","type":"text","version":1}],"direction":null,"format":"","indent":0,"type":"paragraph","version":1,"textFormat":0,"textStyle":""},{"children":[{"detail":0,"format":0,"mode":"normal","style":"","text":"这会大大提高体验，而且一次不行就改进准备措施再来。","type":"text","version":1}],"direction":null,"format":"","indent":0,"type":"paragraph","version":1,"textFormat":0,"textStyle":""},{"children":[{"detail":0,"format":0,"mode":"normal","style":"","text":"世界上没有什么已经确定的知识顶得住这样的进攻，你一定会赢的。","type":"text","version":1}],"direction":null,"format":"","indent":0,"type":"paragraph","version":1,"textFormat":0,"textStyle":""},{"children":[{"detail":0,"format":0,"mode":"normal","style":"","text":"赢多了自然不怕了。","type":"text","version":1}],"direction":null,"format":"","indent":0,"type":"paragraph","version":1,"textFormat":0,"textStyle":""},{"children":[{"detail":0,"format":0,"mode":"normal","style":"","text":"去试试吧。","type":"text","version":1}],"direction":null,"format":"","indent":0,"type":"paragraph","version":1,"textFormat":0,"textStyle":""},{"children":[],"direction":null,"format":"","indent":0,"type":"paragraph","version":1,"textFormat":0,"textStyle":""}],"direction":null,"format":"","indent":0,"type":"root","version":1}}

{"root":{"children":[{"children":[{"detail":0,"format":0,"mode":"normal","style":"","text":"老公的生活背景是个大家庭，氛围很好。每周日都要聚会，长辈和小辈都要去舅舅家吃饭，刚开始结婚之前和结完婚后我也经常去，一来是混个脸熟，二来是我的生长环境和老公家不一样，我们家亲戚比较少，和亲戚平时的聚会也很少，所以感觉他们家很温馨很热闹。

但是去了几次后感觉很累，不能跟在自己家一样想干嘛就干嘛，困了也不能睡觉，老公说你去里屋睡觉呀去歇会，话是这样说，还是不方便。而且工作日要上班，周末就想睡个懒觉，干些自己的事情。就算是在家呆一天我也开心，毕竟我过了我想过的周末，而不是去陪聊天陪应酬，真心觉得每周都去很累也很没必要，我和老公因为这个事吵过两次架，老公说好几次我没有去，大家都问我怎么没有来...我心想：大哥，只有公婆可能是真心的问一下，其他亲戚谁会在乎我真的来了没来啊？而且要去家里才算是家庭聚会，之前小外甥过生日我们一大家子在外边吃了饭，我想着这就算是见面或者聚会了吧？但是不行，到周末老公又叫我去，我又要崩溃了，能不能有个舒坦日子了？我是嫁给你了不是嫁给你一大家子了？再说了你自己去就可以了，谁规定去吃个饭必须要媳妇也跟着？你这是道德捆绑吗？我不去就是不喜欢你亲戚们了吗？我不去就是不想融入你们了吗？你要知道你现在结婚了，谁没点自己是事自己的生活？我总不能啥事不干天天在你舅家呆着吧？

本来我对他们亲戚没有什么意见也很有好感的，现在因为聚会这个事弄得我头大，一到周末我就条件反射神经绷紧，之前我也很愿意去，但是现在老公越提我越不想去...有点像叛逆期的小孩子那样，家长让干啥就不干啥，你别说了你越说我越烦。","type":"text","version":1}],"direction":null,"format":"","indent":0,"type":"quote","version":1},{"children":[{"detail":0,"format":0,"mode":"normal","style":"","text":"这种聚会是有诀窍的，用不着一辈子次次不落的坚持去。","type":"text","version":1}],"direction":null,"format":"","indent":0,"type":"paragraph","version":1,"textFormat":0,"textStyle":""},{"children":[{"detail":0,"format":0,"mode":"normal","style":"","text":"你只需要达到一个标准，就可以相当自由的减少参加频率——确保你不在的时候你的名声不会变坏。","type":"text","version":1}],"direction":null,"format":"","indent":0,"type":"paragraph","version":1,"textFormat":0,"textStyle":""},{"children":[{"detail":0,"format":0,"mode":"normal","style":"","text":"这可以更确切的表达为——当你缺席而有人提出负面批评时，现场会有足够多的人为你辩护。","type":"text","version":1}],"direction":null,"format":"","indent":0,"type":"paragraph","version":1,"textFormat":0,"textStyle":""},{"children":[{"detail":0,"format":0,"mode":"normal","style":"","text":"你要争取你不在时有足够多的人为你辩护，这就反推出一个显然的结论——在早期，作为新人，你要比谁都去得勤。","type":"text","version":1}],"direction":null,"format":"","indent":0,"type":"paragraph","version":1,"textFormat":0,"textStyle":""},{"children":[{"detail":0,"format":0,"mode":"normal","style":"","text":"不但场场必到，还要热切交往，深入接触。","type":"text","version":1}],"direction":null,"format":"","indent":0,"type":"paragraph","version":1,"textFormat":0,"textStyle":""},{"children":[{"detail":0,"format":0,"mode":"normal","style":"","text":"你的目的是尽快了解亲戚们的需求，然后尽快找到你可帮的忙，低调的、你知我知的伸手帮一帮。","type":"text","version":1}],"direction":null,"format":"","indent":0,"type":"paragraph","version":1,"textFormat":0,"textStyle":""},{"children":[{"detail":0,"format":0,"mode":"normal","style":"","text":"道理很朴素——人人欠你情，你不在，自然有人替你说话。","type":"text","version":1}],"direction":null,"format":"","indent":0,"type":"paragraph","version":1,"textFormat":0,"textStyle":""},{"children":[{"detail":0,"format":0,"mode":"normal","style":"","text":"有人替你说话，你不去不会导致评价滑坡，丈夫的社交压力也自然就不会那么大。他压力不大，自然就不会阻挠你的自由安排了。","type":"text","version":1}],"direction":null,"format":"","indent":0,"type":"paragraph","version":1,"textFormat":0,"textStyle":""},{"children":[{"detail":0,"format":0,"mode":"normal","style":"","text":"除了早期要主动出击，打下之后自由灵活的基础、还要注意自己人不去，意思要去。","type":"text","version":1}],"direction":null,"format":"","indent":0,"type":"paragraph","version":1,"textFormat":0,"textStyle":""},{"children":[{"detail":0,"format":0,"mode":"normal","style":"","text":"也就是人没去时，要委托丈夫给你新交的朋友们时不时带上一些礼物，或者为聚会活动分担一些费用。","type":"text","version":1}],"direction":null,"format":"","indent":0,"type":"paragraph","version":1,"textFormat":0,"textStyle":""},{"children":[{"detail":0,"format":0,"mode":"normal","style":"","text":"这样你不去ta们自然就更不会随便怪你了。","type":"text","version":1}],"direction":null,"format":"","indent":0,"type":"paragraph","version":1,"textFormat":0,"textStyle":""},{"children":[{"detail":0,"format":0,"mode":"normal","style":"","text":"到这一步，基本你就已经自由了。","type":"text","version":1}],"direction":null,"format":"","indent":0,"type":"paragraph","version":1,"textFormat":0,"textStyle":""},{"children":[],"direction":null,"format":"","indent":0,"type":"paragraph","version":1,"textFormat":0,"textStyle":""}],"direction":null,"format":"","indent":0,"type":"root","version":1}}

{"root":{"children":[{"children":[{"detail":0,"format":0,"mode":"normal","style":"","text":"衣柜隔层少，放置衣物，开始的时候整理得挺整齐。往往过段时间后，柜子会因为找衣服弄乱，或者新洗干净的衣物放进去后，又变得不整齐。我曾想过同类归纳，裤子放一起，T恤放一起，时间久了就又变乱了（而且搭配不起来）。每次因为想找某件衣服找不到的时候，就会很苦恼。也曾按照同一套搭配装在收纳袋里，结果也找不到某件衣服。

后来，即使打了很多柜子、又购置收纳箱（关于收纳，甚至读了书买了课），采取了这些增加收纳空间的措施，并未改善找不衣服、衣柜堆积变乱情况。这导致了衣物的堆积和闲置。比如有些衣物要使用而未找到，只能找到什么就直接用了。尤其是每年春秋、夏季、冬季，衣服循环换季，就会出现这种问题，常常去年用的今年找不到了——真令人挫败。

可能本人对于分类、分界一向很不擅长，想请教一下，就衣物整理而言，该如何进行分类，进而合理划分收纳空间呢？如果有幸得到“分类“原则的再进一步指点，不胜感激。","type":"text","version":1}],"direction":null,"format":"","indent":0,"type":"quote","version":1},{"children":[{"detail":0,"format":0,"mode":"normal","style":"","text":"衣物要收纳整齐，有一个非常关键的诀窍，就是不能堆叠。","type":"text","version":1}],"direction":null,"format":"","indent":0,"type":"paragraph","version":1,"textFormat":0,"textStyle":""},{"children":[{"detail":0,"format":0,"mode":"normal","style":"","text":"绝不要有一件衣服压在另一件衣服之上。","type":"text","version":1}],"direction":null,"format":"","indent":0,"type":"paragraph","version":1,"textFormat":0,"textStyle":""},{"children":[{"detail":0,"format":0,"mode":"normal","style":"","text":"就这么简单。","type":"text","version":1}],"direction":null,"format":"","indent":0,"type":"paragraph","version":1,"textFormat":0,"textStyle":""},{"children":[{"detail":0,"format":0,"mode":"normal","style":"","text":"几乎所有的衣服的混乱问题都跟这种收纳方式有关，最典型的就是在抽屉里放了三层衣服，于是你要翻找下面的衣服就要把上面的衣服移开。","type":"text","version":1}],"direction":null,"format":"","indent":0,"type":"paragraph","version":1,"textFormat":0,"textStyle":""},{"children":[{"detail":0,"format":0,"mode":"normal","style":"","text":"衣物都是软的，这种翻找就总是造成灾难性的后果——翻得乱七八糟。","type":"text","version":1}],"direction":null,"format":"","indent":0,"type":"paragraph","version":1,"textFormat":0,"textStyle":""},{"children":[{"detail":0,"format":0,"mode":"normal","style":"","text":"如果你仔细分析一下这个问题，就会发现它本质上是由两个环节造成的：","type":"text","version":1}],"direction":null,"format":"","indent":0,"type":"paragraph","version":1,"textFormat":0,"textStyle":""},{"children":[{"detail":0,"format":0,"mode":"normal","style":"","text":"1）观察有阻碍，导致必须翻找。","type":"text","version":1}],"direction":null,"format":"","indent":0,"type":"paragraph","version":1,"textFormat":0,"textStyle":""},{"children":[{"detail":0,"format":0,"mode":"normal","style":"","text":"2）拿取有障碍，导致取用部分衣物时必然扰动别的衣物。","type":"text","version":1}],"direction":null,"format":"","indent":0,"type":"paragraph","version":1,"textFormat":0,"textStyle":""},{"children":[{"detail":0,"format":0,"mode":"normal","style":"","text":"解决的手段自然也就要对症下药——","type":"text","version":1}],"direction":null,"format":"","indent":0,"type":"paragraph","version":1,"textFormat":0,"textStyle":""},{"children":[{"detail":0,"format":0,"mode":"normal","style":"","text":"1）应挂尽挂。所有的外套、外裤都挂起来。而不要采用叠放方式。挂起的衣服不但较为舒展，而且完全符合“观察无遮挡，拿取无阻碍”的收纳原则。但需要注意的是，一些衣服可能对重力的拉扯较为敏感，长期垂挂容易变形，可能需要一些折叠悬挂的技巧，对衣架的承托性也要有所考虑（例如太薄的衣架可能破坏肩部形状）。","type":"text","version":1}],"direction":null,"format":"","indent":0,"type":"paragraph","version":1,"textFormat":0,"textStyle":""},{"children":[{"detail":0,"format":0,"mode":"normal","style":"","text":"2）内裤、内衣、袜子、毛衣这类完全没有外形要求的衣服，都采用卷式收纳——卷成一个个的“卷饼”——然后肩并肩，像排木桩一样“插”在抽屉里。","type":"text","version":1}],"direction":null,"format":"","indent":0,"type":"paragraph","version":1,"textFormat":0,"textStyle":""},{"children":[{"detail":0,"format":0,"mode":"normal","style":"","text":"这样首先不存在要拿来一件才能看见另一件的问题。其次，到了拿取的时候，直接往上一抽就可以，不会影响其它衣物的收纳状态。","type":"text","version":1}],"direction":null,"format":"","indent":0,"type":"paragraph","version":1,"textFormat":0,"textStyle":""},{"children":[{"detail":0,"format":0,"mode":"normal","style":"","text":"这就完全达到了“既简洁明了，又不容易乱”的目的了。","type":"text","version":1}],"direction":null,"format":"","indent":0,"type":"paragraph","version":1,"textFormat":0,"textStyle":""},{"children":[{"detail":0,"format":0,"mode":"normal","style":"","text":"顺着这个“观察与拿取均不允许被遮挡”的思路，你还可以有更多的发挥，这里就不一一列举了。","type":"text","version":1}],"direction":null,"format":"","indent":0,"type":"paragraph","version":1,"textFormat":0,"textStyle":""},{"children":[],"direction":null,"format":"","indent":0,"type":"paragraph","version":1,"textFormat":0,"textStyle":""},{"children":[],"direction":null,"format":"","indent":0,"type":"paragraph","version":1,"textFormat":0,"textStyle":""}],"direction":null,"format":"","indent":0,"type":"root","version":1}}

{"root":{"children":[{"children":[{"detail":0,"format":0,"mode":"normal","style":"","text":"最近，在下做了一个重要的职业转型决定，准备从稳定的行业跳到一个充满未知的新领域。在做出这个决定之前，已经做了大量的市场调研和自我评估，认为这是实现个人价值的最佳路径。

然而，当在下把这个想法告诉家人和朋友时，几乎所有人都表示不理解甚至强烈反对，他们认为我放弃了已有的优势，选择了一条风险极高的路，甚至有人质疑能力。面对这些铺天盖地的反对声，在下内心也开始动摇，甚至怀疑自己是不是过于理想化了。尽管如此，内心深处那个声音却一直告诉我这是对的。这种被所有人质疑的感觉真的很不好受。想问问大家，应该如何审视判断？坚持独立判断，如果遭遇不同意的声音，要做些什么？

坚持意味着什么呢？如果结果不好就是错误，在下也会动摇，可是这等价于只要预期不良/声势浩大就会动摇，预期不良/声势浩大而不动摇的行为，好像想象不到。见识到了答主打疫情、俄乌、蔚来、西贝等等大逆风局，非常钦佩，是如何坚持呢？","type":"text","version":1}],"direction":null,"format":"","indent":0,"type":"quote","version":1},{"children":[{"detail":0,"format":0,"mode":"normal","style":"","text":"周围所有亲人、爱人普遍的甚至是铁板一块的不赞同你时，建议你将之视为“确实不能做”的信号，暂时搁置你的打算。","type":"text","version":1}],"direction":null,"format":"","indent":0,"type":"paragraph","version":1,"textFormat":0,"textStyle":""},{"children":[{"detail":0,"format":0,"mode":"normal","style":"","text":"ta们是你身边最亲近的人，你的计划引起了这么多亲人的焦虑，有很大可能是ta们以自己对你的观察，对你能经受住其中某些环节的考验有很大的顾虑。","type":"text","version":1}],"direction":null,"format":"","indent":0,"type":"paragraph","version":1,"textFormat":0,"textStyle":""},{"children":[{"detail":0,"format":0,"mode":"normal","style":"","text":"而在这个问题上，ta们很可能是比你本人更有效的判断者。","type":"text","version":1}],"direction":null,"format":"","indent":0,"type":"paragraph","version":1,"textFormat":0,"textStyle":""},{"children":[{"detail":0,"format":0,"mode":"normal","style":"","text":"换一个角度，家人是你执行复杂计划最重要的支撑，如果ta们过于忧虑而你强行上马，对ta们会是很大的情绪挑战和折磨；如果ta们在途中出问题，对你的计划执行也会是一个巨大的阻碍，更会令你原本考虑好的计划变得不够可靠。","type":"text","version":1}],"direction":null,"format":"","indent":0,"type":"paragraph","version":1,"textFormat":0,"textStyle":""},{"children":[{"detail":0,"format":0,"mode":"normal","style":"","text":"这跟我“打逆风局”是不同的，因为我的“逆风局”不涉及什么具体执行，仅仅只是就事论事、以据辩理，而且主要是为认为受误解、受损害的一方提供声援和帮助，为深受形势拉扯而倍感焦虑的你们给出我能给予的服务。","type":"text","version":1}],"direction":null,"format":"","indent":0,"type":"paragraph","version":1,"textFormat":0,"textStyle":""},{"children":[{"detail":0,"format":0,"mode":"normal","style":"","text":"这跟你尝试进行职业转型的性质是不同的。","type":"text","version":1}],"direction":null,"format":"","indent":0,"type":"paragraph","version":1,"textFormat":0,"textStyle":""},{"children":[{"detail":0,"format":0,"mode":"normal","style":"","text":"我是朝着对手，为保护我所爱的而战；而你是为挣脱爱你的，为你自己的执念而战啊。","type":"text","version":1}],"direction":null,"format":"","indent":0,"type":"paragraph","version":1,"textFormat":0,"textStyle":""},{"children":[{"detail":0,"format":0,"mode":"normal","style":"","text":"是的，执念。","type":"text","version":1}],"direction":null,"format":"","indent":0,"type":"paragraph","version":1,"textFormat":0,"textStyle":""},{"children":[{"detail":0,"format":0,"mode":"normal","style":"","text":"我始终有一个信念——爱我的人必然是真诚为我考虑的，如果这个世界上有人有权挡在我和我的欲求之间，让我心甘情愿的搁置我的打算，那就必然是ta们。","type":"text","version":1}],"direction":null,"format":"","indent":0,"type":"paragraph","version":1,"textFormat":0,"textStyle":""},{"children":[{"detail":0,"format":0,"mode":"normal","style":"","text":"如果阻拦我的是敌人、是路人，那么这是我的意志是否坚定的问题，甚至恰恰是敌人阻拦我，我反而越视为升帆、加油的信号。","type":"text","version":1}],"direction":null,"format":"","indent":0,"type":"paragraph","version":1,"textFormat":0,"textStyle":""},{"children":[{"detail":0,"format":0,"mode":"normal","style":"","text":"但阻拦我的是曾为我牺牲、受屈的亲人、爱人，那么只要我不能让ta们灵魂安宁、信心安定的支持，我就视为是上天在通过ta们告诉我“还不行”。","type":"text","version":1}],"direction":null,"format":"","indent":0,"type":"paragraph","version":1,"textFormat":0,"textStyle":""},{"children":[{"detail":0,"format":0,"mode":"normal","style":"","text":"不是“永远不行”“绝对不行”，而是“还不行”“这样不行”。","type":"text","version":1}],"direction":null,"format":"","indent":0,"type":"paragraph","version":1,"textFormat":0,"textStyle":""},{"children":[{"detail":0,"format":0,"mode":"normal","style":"","text":"我若是仍然想做，我就修订我的方案，花费更多的时间，寻求ta们的认可。","type":"text","version":1}],"direction":null,"format":"","indent":0,"type":"paragraph","version":1,"textFormat":0,"textStyle":""},{"children":[{"detail":0,"format":0,"mode":"normal","style":"","text":"ta们是爱我的，天然就有乐于自我牺牲成全我的打算，这是什么意思？意思是ta们作为主考官，会放水放到连公式到底通不通都不核算，仅仅看我证明得十分用功、冷静、诚恳，就会放我过关。","type":"text","version":1}],"direction":null,"format":"","indent":0,"type":"paragraph","version":1,"textFormat":0,"textStyle":""},{"children":[{"detail":0,"format":0,"mode":"normal","style":"","text":"而如果在这么好考的考官手里我都拿不到及格，如果我连ta们也不能扎扎实实的说服、安抚，我的计划只能被视为是真的不够成熟的。","type":"text","version":1}],"direction":null,"format":"","indent":0,"type":"paragraph","version":1,"textFormat":0,"textStyle":""},{"children":[{"detail":0,"format":0,"mode":"normal","style":"","text":"而因此耽误的机会、错过的时间，也就不可以被视为是被这些亲人、爱人耽误，而只能被视为是被计划不够周全、机缘不够成熟而耽误。","type":"text","version":1}],"direction":null,"format":"","indent":0,"type":"paragraph","version":1,"textFormat":0,"textStyle":""},{"children":[{"detail":0,"format":0,"mode":"normal","style":"","text":"我也可以因此单纯而固执的坚信被耽误一定是最好的结果、相信我如果硬干一定会比不干更糟糕——哪怕有一个和我看起来差不多的人干了并且结果令人羡慕，也一定是“我不是ta，我来干肯定完蛋”。","type":"text","version":1}],"direction":null,"format":"","indent":0,"type":"paragraph","version":1,"textFormat":0,"textStyle":""},{"children":[{"detail":0,"format":0,"mode":"normal","style":"","text":"所以，你就安下心来，好好的去说服吧。你会发现，其实ta们是被你那个“如果不能好好说服你们，我宁可不做”的心甘情愿的态度说服的，而不是你的数学公式和市场分析。","type":"text","version":1}],"direction":null,"format":"","indent":0,"type":"paragraph","version":1,"textFormat":0,"textStyle":""},{"children":[{"detail":0,"format":0,"mode":"normal","style":"","text":"而证明你这个态度的最好证据，就是你会愿意不断的调整你的方案，不断的降低预期风险——例如缩小前期投入规模。","type":"text","version":1}],"direction":null,"format":"","indent":0,"type":"paragraph","version":1,"textFormat":0,"textStyle":""},{"children":[{"detail":0,"format":0,"mode":"normal","style":"","text":"只要你确信ta们是真心实意爱你的，你就要力求争取这些世上最好争取的人的祝福，明白吗？","type":"text","version":1}],"direction":null,"format":"","indent":0,"type":"paragraph","version":1,"textFormat":0,"textStyle":""},{"children":[{"detail":0,"format":0,"mode":"normal","style":"","text":"因为如果连这条线也抹去，世上就没有“一意孤行”这个概念了。","type":"text","version":1}],"direction":null,"format":"","indent":0,"type":"paragraph","version":1,"textFormat":0,"textStyle":""},{"children":[],"direction":null,"format":"","indent":0,"type":"paragraph","version":1,"textFormat":0,"textStyle":""}],"direction":null,"format":"","indent":0,"type":"root","version":1}}

{"root":{"children":[{"children":[{"detail":0,"format":0,"mode":"normal","style":"","text":"如何鼓励孩子去勇敢面对自己的不足？

有时候，ta缺乏信心。总自责自己做的还是不够好，距离标准答案太远了，直接不想做。可是，错只是说明在体验成长，是勇敢的表现，这是变强大的日常。结果越怕出错越出错。而且，ta感觉自己只会按照同样的方式处理不同的事情，常常担心自己很刻板。

有时候，ta总是嘴硬。ta会无限的合理化自己犯的错误，哪怕已经圆得非常不合理了，还要继续圆，且长期坚持自己的低级自洽的说法，不高兴别人提起这件事，尤其不接受别人说他做得不对。","type":"text","version":1}],"direction":null,"format":"","indent":0,"type":"quote","version":1},{"children":[{"detail":0,"format":0,"mode":"normal","style":"","text":"作为父母，有一个诀窍，那就是一旦发现孩子身上有什么问题，第一时间不要想着孩子有什么需要改进的地方，而要思考自己身上有什么需要改进的地方。","type":"text","version":1}],"direction":null,"format":"","indent":0,"type":"paragraph","version":1,"textFormat":0,"textStyle":""},{"children":[{"detail":0,"format":0,"mode":"normal","style":"","text":"不要先去想孩子应该怎么办、应该怎么改变，而是要去想自己应该什么地方做得不同，怎么改变。","type":"text","version":1}],"direction":null,"format":"","indent":0,"type":"paragraph","version":1,"textFormat":0,"textStyle":""},{"children":[{"detail":0,"format":0,"mode":"normal","style":"","text":"然后用自己的改变去导致、触发孩子的改变。","type":"text","version":1}],"direction":null,"format":"","indent":0,"type":"paragraph","version":1,"textFormat":0,"textStyle":""},{"children":[{"detail":0,"format":0,"mode":"normal","style":"","text":"孩子就像一块烧熔的玻璃，而父母、学校、同学、亲友就像玻璃的印模，玻璃的形状实际上是跟着印模来的，而且这其中父母是最大的一块。","type":"text","version":1}],"direction":null,"format":"","indent":0,"type":"paragraph","version":1,"textFormat":0,"textStyle":""},{"children":[{"detail":0,"format":0,"mode":"normal","style":"","text":"所以解决问题的思路一定是“我的言行中有什么地方不太注意，以至于让ta有了如此坚定的错误认识”。","type":"text","version":1}],"direction":null,"format":"","indent":0,"type":"paragraph","version":1,"textFormat":0,"textStyle":""},{"children":[{"detail":0,"format":0,"mode":"normal","style":"","text":"我做了什么，说了什么，漫不经心的让你因为坦承错误而受伤了，而我自己却没有发现。","type":"text","version":1}],"direction":null,"format":"","indent":0,"type":"paragraph","version":1,"textFormat":0,"textStyle":""},{"children":[{"detail":0,"format":0,"mode":"normal","style":"","text":"我是不是屡屡错过了肯定你直面错误的勇气的机会，对这种英勇熟视无睹，以至于你为此勇敢承担的内心惶恐没有得到任何回应？","type":"text","version":1}],"direction":null,"format":"","indent":0,"type":"paragraph","version":1,"textFormat":0,"textStyle":""},{"children":[{"detail":0,"format":0,"mode":"normal","style":"","text":"我是不是因为你屡屡未能克服你主动承认的困难而骂你愚蠢，甚至责备你逃避、软弱，以至于你绝望的发现还不如一开始就坚决不承认，把这番折磨掐死在萌芽之中？","type":"text","version":1}],"direction":null,"format":"","indent":0,"type":"paragraph","version":1,"textFormat":0,"textStyle":""},{"children":[{"detail":0,"format":0,"mode":"normal","style":"","text":"我是不是曾经无意中附和那些嘲笑你的同学的说法，试图用“健康的羞耻感”刺激你努力——或者不如更诚实地说——恶意的报复你给我带来羞耻的“罪行”？","type":"text","version":1}],"direction":null,"format":"","indent":0,"type":"paragraph","version":1,"textFormat":0,"textStyle":""},{"children":[{"detail":0,"format":0,"mode":"normal","style":"","text":"我要深深的搜索我的记忆，并请你帮我回忆，因为我可能为了逃避我的错误而不自觉地自我欺骗。","type":"text","version":1}],"direction":null,"format":"","indent":0,"type":"paragraph","version":1,"textFormat":0,"textStyle":""},{"children":[{"detail":0,"format":0,"mode":"normal","style":"","text":"我的孩子，你看，我要认这个错有多不容易——如果不是看到你的反应，我根本不会意识到我已经错过了这么多；如果没有你的帮助，我甚至回忆不起、无法承认我做过这些。","type":"text","version":1}],"direction":null,"format":"","indent":0,"type":"paragraph","version":1,"textFormat":0,"textStyle":""},{"children":[{"detail":0,"format":0,"mode":"normal","style":"","text":"我现在真诚的向你道歉，你会这样害怕面对错误，我有责任。","type":"text","version":1}],"direction":null,"format":"","indent":0,"type":"paragraph","version":1,"textFormat":0,"textStyle":""},{"children":[{"detail":0,"format":0,"mode":"normal","style":"","text":"那么，我的孩子，你现在因此而看不起我了吗？你会嘲笑我吗？","type":"text","version":1}],"direction":null,"format":"","indent":0,"type":"paragraph","version":1,"textFormat":0,"textStyle":""},{"children":[{"detail":0,"format":0,"mode":"normal","style":"","text":"你发现了吗？","type":"text","version":1}],"direction":null,"format":"","indent":0,"type":"paragraph","version":1,"textFormat":0,"textStyle":""},{"children":[{"detail":0,"format":0,"mode":"normal","style":"","text":"其实你没有。","type":"text","version":1}],"direction":null,"format":"","indent":0,"type":"paragraph","version":1,"textFormat":0,"textStyle":""},{"children":[{"detail":0,"format":0,"mode":"normal","style":"","text":"而纵使你嘲笑我、鄙视我，请相信我，我会做的和现在也不会有什么不同。","type":"text","version":1}],"direction":null,"format":"","indent":0,"type":"paragraph","version":1,"textFormat":0,"textStyle":""},{"children":[{"detail":0,"format":0,"mode":"normal","style":"","text":"因为比起受嘲笑、受鄙视，我更关心我这样改变，能不能帮助到你。","type":"text","version":1}],"direction":null,"format":"","indent":0,"type":"paragraph","version":1,"textFormat":0,"textStyle":""},{"children":[{"detail":0,"format":0,"mode":"normal","style":"","text":"我会尝试改正这些言行，但你会看到的，这些错误并不容易改掉，我也需要你一次又一次的提醒我，我也只能一次又一次的尝试。","type":"text","version":1}],"direction":null,"format":"","indent":0,"type":"paragraph","version":1,"textFormat":0,"textStyle":""},{"children":[{"detail":0,"format":0,"mode":"normal","style":"","text":"你会因为我这么笨、这么屡教不改而嘲笑我，鄙视我吗？","type":"text","version":1}],"direction":null,"format":"","indent":0,"type":"paragraph","version":1,"textFormat":0,"textStyle":""},{"children":[{"detail":0,"format":0,"mode":"normal","style":"","text":"这个到后面我屡屡犯错被提醒时，我们再验证吧。","type":"text","version":1}],"direction":null,"format":"","indent":0,"type":"paragraph","version":1,"textFormat":0,"textStyle":""},{"children":[{"detail":0,"format":0,"mode":"normal","style":"","text":"我的孩子，你知道人生最大的难关是什么吗？","type":"text","version":1}],"direction":null,"format":"","indent":0,"type":"paragraph","version":1,"textFormat":0,"textStyle":""},{"children":[{"detail":0,"format":0,"mode":"normal","style":"","text":"最大的难关不是解决问题、不是表现完美、不是无懈可击，而恰恰就是认错本身。","type":"text","version":1}],"direction":null,"format":"","indent":0,"type":"paragraph","version":1,"textFormat":0,"textStyle":""},{"children":[{"detail":0,"format":0,"mode":"normal","style":"","text":"你会发现，人生千千万万的课题，不管是英语、数学，还是卖东西、工作、谈恋爱，都是在不断的考验人认错的功夫和技术。是的，“认错”本身就是一个专业，是一个技能，是一种功夫。","type":"text","version":1}],"direction":null,"format":"","indent":0,"type":"paragraph","version":1,"textFormat":0,"textStyle":""},{"children":[{"detail":0,"format":0,"mode":"normal","style":"","text":"是一种神通，一种修炼好了能让人敬畏的神力。","type":"text","version":1}],"direction":null,"format":"","indent":0,"type":"paragraph","version":1,"textFormat":0,"textStyle":""},{"children":[{"detail":0,"format":0,"mode":"normal","style":"","text":"它是很不好练的，但把它练好了，这个世界上就没有什么是你绝对无法企及的。","type":"text","version":1}],"direction":null,"format":"","indent":0,"type":"paragraph","version":1,"textFormat":0,"textStyle":""},{"children":[{"detail":0,"format":0,"mode":"normal","style":"","text":"所以，千千万万不要因为我的愚蠢而拒绝和抛弃这门最重要的修炼。","type":"text","version":1}],"direction":null,"format":"","indent":0,"type":"paragraph","version":1,"textFormat":0,"textStyle":""},{"children":[{"detail":0,"format":0,"mode":"normal","style":"","text":"那么，我的孩子，你看到我因为这次认错而受辱、受损了吗？","type":"text","version":1}],"direction":null,"format":"","indent":0,"type":"paragraph","version":1,"textFormat":0,"textStyle":""},{"children":[{"detail":0,"format":0,"mode":"normal","style":"","text":"所以，并不是所有主动的认错都会受辱、受损的，对吗？即使是一时根本改不好的那种，也不会仅仅因为承认而成为灾难。","type":"text","version":1}],"direction":null,"format":"","indent":0,"type":"paragraph","version":1,"textFormat":0,"textStyle":""},{"children":[{"detail":0,"format":0,"mode":"normal","style":"","text":"是吗？","type":"text","version":1}],"direction":null,"format":"","indent":0,"type":"paragraph","version":1,"textFormat":0,"textStyle":""},{"children":[{"detail":0,"format":0,"mode":"normal","style":"","text":"为什么我没有受到折磨？","type":"text","version":1}],"direction":null,"format":"","indent":0,"type":"paragraph","version":1,"textFormat":0,"textStyle":""},{"children":[{"detail":0,"format":0,"mode":"normal","style":"","text":"因为你爱我，胜过了我爱你。","type":"text","version":1}],"direction":null,"format":"","indent":0,"type":"paragraph","version":1,"textFormat":0,"textStyle":""},{"children":[{"detail":0,"format":0,"mode":"normal","style":"","text":"你给我的是孩子对父母的纯真的爱，我一点也不怀疑。","type":"text","version":1}],"direction":null,"format":"","indent":0,"type":"paragraph","version":1,"textFormat":0,"textStyle":""},{"children":[{"detail":0,"format":0,"mode":"normal","style":"","text":"而我给你的却是我在世上沉浮，因为沾染了无数焦虑、恐惧、傲慢后磨损了的爱。","type":"text","version":1}],"direction":null,"format":"","indent":0,"type":"paragraph","version":1,"textFormat":0,"textStyle":""},{"children":[{"detail":0,"format":0,"mode":"normal","style":"","text":"你此刻对我的宽容，其实胜过了我平时对你的宽容。所以我对你可以这么大胆的认错而不害怕，而你对我认错，我却常给你不该有的残忍。","type":"text","version":1}],"direction":null,"format":"","indent":0,"type":"paragraph","version":1,"textFormat":0,"textStyle":""},{"children":[{"detail":0,"format":0,"mode":"normal","style":"","text":"我要向你学习，是我错了。","type":"text","version":1}],"direction":null,"format":"","indent":0,"type":"paragraph","version":1,"textFormat":0,"textStyle":""},{"children":[{"detail":0,"format":0,"mode":"normal","style":"","text":"我还可能再犯，那时候你再提醒我吧。","type":"text","version":1}],"direction":null,"format":"","indent":0,"type":"paragraph","version":1,"textFormat":0,"textStyle":""},{"children":[{"detail":0,"format":0,"mode":"normal","style":"","text":"希望我刚才做的这些，能让你对认错这件事不再那么顾虑。但就像我刚才说的，这是一门盖世神功，练成了无坚不摧，所以我们也不能指望看一看就突然练成了。","type":"text","version":1}],"direction":null,"format":"","indent":0,"type":"paragraph","version":1,"textFormat":0,"textStyle":""},{"children":[{"detail":0,"format":0,"mode":"normal","style":"","text":"我们慢慢来吧。","type":"text","version":1}],"direction":null,"format":"","indent":0,"type":"paragraph","version":1,"textFormat":0,"textStyle":""},{"children":[{"detail":0,"format":0,"mode":"normal","style":"","text":"我给你做十个俯卧撑，向你道歉。","type":"text","version":1}],"direction":null,"format":"","indent":0,"type":"paragraph","version":1,"textFormat":0,"textStyle":""},{"children":[{"detail":0,"format":0,"mode":"normal","style":"","text":"下次再犯，再做十个。","type":"text","version":1}],"direction":null,"format":"","indent":0,"type":"paragraph","version":1,"textFormat":0,"textStyle":""},{"children":[],"direction":null,"format":"","indent":0,"type":"paragraph","version":1,"textFormat":0,"textStyle":""},{"type":"horizontalrule","version":1},{"children":[{"detail":0,"format":0,"mode":"normal","style":"","text":"记住，你只能通过改变自己去推动孩子的改变，别问孩子应该怎么改正，要问自己应该怎么改正。","type":"text","version":1}],"direction":null,"format":"","indent":0,"type":"paragraph","version":1,"textFormat":0,"textStyle":""},{"children":[{"detail":0,"format":0,"mode":"normal","style":"","text":"自己体会吧。","type":"text","version":1}],"direction":null,"format":"","indent":0,"type":"paragraph","version":1,"textFormat":0,"textStyle":""},{"children":[],"direction":null,"format":"","indent":0,"type":"paragraph","version":1,"textFormat":0,"textStyle":""}],"direction":null,"format":"","indent":0,"type":"root","version":1}}

{"root":{"children":[{"children":[{"detail":0,"format":0,"mode":"normal","style":"","text":"我是爸爸妈妈领养的孩子，上面有两个哥哥现在已经成家了。我现在就读高中，前段时间因为抑郁症把家里人折腾的不轻.那段时间最常听到的话就是“看着你这样我心里也好苦”“不知道你为什么会有这样的想法，明明以前是一个多开朗的小孩”听到这些我有点迷茫。以前真的开朗嘛？我不知道。

今天在餐桌上看见爸爸妈妈疲劳的身体，突然感想，没有我他们是不是就会轻松很多？家里并不富裕但也不是贫困，爸爸会出外面上班（应该算进厂吧），妈妈时不时去卖菜。有时候我会问妈妈，这样供我读书是不是很辛苦？爸爸听了就说“只要我和你妈妈没病没灾供你读书就没有问题”我有点恐慌。我最常听到的就是妈妈告诉我要节约，体谅爸爸这么大年纪（近六十了）挣钱不容易.我经常会想，我对于这个家庭算不算负担？如果没有我，爸爸妈妈现在应该在含饴弄孙吧？不需要这么勤劳的挣钱，最多也就搞点吃的的钱。

爸爸妈妈想我考上大学以后结婚生子最好在本地，可是我并没有这些想法，我感觉有点累了。我不太明白我活着的意义了，这两天的身体很疲惫，很贪睡。但也是我睡得最安稳的时候，睡着了多好啊，一片虚无。如果我就这么去了，是不是会觉得我很自私？觉得我的爸爸妈妈就算辛苦也供了我十几年书，就这么撒手人寰一定也对不起他们？那我该怎么做呢？应该打鸡血去奋斗吗？搏一搏单车变摩托？可是我很累啊，这已经不是第一次挣扎了。就这样活下去那我是在为谁活呢？","type":"text","version":1}],"direction":null,"format":"","indent":0,"type":"quote","version":1},{"children":[{"detail":0,"format":0,"mode":"normal","style":"","text":"子女听到父母喊辛苦，最容易犯的错误就是认为这是一种抱怨。","type":"text","version":1}],"direction":null,"format":"","indent":0,"type":"paragraph","version":1,"textFormat":0,"textStyle":""},{"children":[{"detail":0,"format":0,"mode":"normal","style":"","text":"父母的辛苦其实是一种原料，是可以通过结出果实而转化为幸福的东西。ta们要的根本不是“解除辛苦”，而是“辛苦结出果实”。","type":"text","version":1}],"direction":null,"format":"","indent":0,"type":"paragraph","version":1,"textFormat":0,"textStyle":""},{"children":[{"detail":0,"format":0,"mode":"normal","style":"","text":"子女只要持续成长着，父母的辛苦本身反而成为一种享受，会带来快感，甚至形成瘾症依赖。","type":"text","version":1}],"direction":null,"format":"","indent":0,"type":"paragraph","version":1,"textFormat":0,"textStyle":""},{"children":[{"detail":0,"format":0,"mode":"normal","style":"","text":"父亲喜欢辛苦一天给女儿买一串糖葫芦，看女儿吃得笑哈哈。让他重新选择，他会毫不犹豫的选择再辛苦一天再买一串糖葫芦，而不会选“女儿不吃糖葫芦，自己也不用累”。","type":"text","version":1}],"direction":null,"format":"","indent":0,"type":"paragraph","version":1,"textFormat":0,"textStyle":""},{"children":[{"detail":0,"format":0,"mode":"normal","style":"","text":"只要子女结出果实，父母的辛苦是一种享受，而不是折磨。","type":"text","version":1}],"direction":null,"format":"","indent":0,"type":"paragraph","version":1,"textFormat":0,"textStyle":""},{"children":[{"detail":0,"format":0,"mode":"normal","style":"","text":"所以父母抱怨的从来就不是辛苦本身，而是子女卡住了后半段工序，不愿意把ta们所提供的辛苦的原料酿造成幸福和欣慰。","type":"text","version":1}],"direction":null,"format":"","indent":0,"type":"paragraph","version":1,"textFormat":0,"textStyle":""},{"children":[{"detail":0,"format":0,"mode":"normal","style":"","text":"是所谓的“不珍惜”。","type":"text","version":1}],"direction":null,"format":"","indent":0,"type":"paragraph","version":1,"textFormat":0,"textStyle":""},{"children":[{"detail":0,"format":0,"mode":"normal","style":"","text":"所以，客观上讲，子女打出“我消失，这样你们就不用辛苦了”这张牌，不但不是在“免除父母的辛苦”，反而是在惩罚和折磨父母，尝试剥夺父母的基本福利和人生价值。","type":"text","version":1}],"direction":null,"format":"","indent":0,"type":"paragraph","version":1,"textFormat":0,"textStyle":""},{"children":[{"detail":0,"format":0,"mode":"normal","style":"","text":"只是用“免除辛苦”包装了一层，看上去似乎很宽大罢了。","type":"text","version":1}],"direction":null,"format":"","indent":0,"type":"paragraph","version":1,"textFormat":0,"textStyle":""},{"children":[{"detail":0,"format":0,"mode":"normal","style":"","text":"因为父母已经辛苦了十几年了，过往的辛苦已成既成事实，大量的原料囤积在你的仓库里等着酿成好酒。","type":"text","version":1}],"direction":null,"format":"","indent":0,"type":"paragraph","version":1,"textFormat":0,"textStyle":""},{"children":[{"detail":0,"format":0,"mode":"normal","style":"","text":"而你因为不想承担酿造责任，决定一把火把这货仓烧了，宣布“你们应该高兴，因为你们以后不需要送更多的原料来了，可以放假了”。","type":"text","version":1}],"direction":null,"format":"","indent":0,"type":"paragraph","version":1,"textFormat":0,"textStyle":""},{"children":[{"detail":0,"format":0,"mode":"normal","style":"","text":"这显然是说不通的，根本就不会造成父母的轻松快乐。","type":"text","version":1}],"direction":null,"format":"","indent":0,"type":"paragraph","version":1,"textFormat":0,"textStyle":""},{"children":[{"detail":0,"format":0,"mode":"normal","style":"","text":"而最可叹的是，你是真的不懂吗？真的不知道这样并不是仁慈、宽免，而是折磨和惩罚吗？","type":"text","version":1}],"direction":null,"format":"","indent":0,"type":"paragraph","version":1,"textFormat":0,"textStyle":""},{"children":[{"detail":0,"format":0,"mode":"normal","style":"","text":"其实你是知道的，你是故意要惩罚ta们——惩罚ta们给你堆了这么满仓的原料，让你背上了巨大的酿造工作量。","type":"text","version":1}],"direction":null,"format":"","indent":0,"type":"paragraph","version":1,"textFormat":0,"textStyle":""},{"children":[{"detail":0,"format":0,"mode":"normal","style":"","text":"而你却根本不会酿酒。","type":"text","version":1}],"direction":null,"format":"","indent":0,"type":"paragraph","version":1,"textFormat":0,"textStyle":""},{"children":[{"detail":0,"format":0,"mode":"normal","style":"","text":"你没法把这些原料酿成酒，这些堆到屋顶的储备只让你觉得痛苦和抑郁。","type":"text","version":1}],"direction":null,"format":"","indent":0,"type":"paragraph","version":1,"textFormat":0,"textStyle":""},{"children":[{"detail":0,"format":0,"mode":"normal","style":"","text":"ta们继续往里堆货，你的痛苦和抑郁就会更甚。","type":"text","version":1}],"direction":null,"format":"","indent":0,"type":"paragraph","version":1,"textFormat":0,"textStyle":""},{"children":[{"detail":0,"format":0,"mode":"normal","style":"","text":"这才是你要用这个看似高尚、仁慈的逻辑去实际惩罚ta们的原因。","type":"text","version":1}],"direction":null,"format":"","indent":0,"type":"paragraph","version":1,"textFormat":0,"textStyle":""},{"children":[{"detail":0,"format":0,"mode":"normal","style":"","text":"这个问题的症结无疑是在酿酒问题上。","type":"text","version":1}],"direction":null,"format":"","indent":0,"type":"paragraph","version":1,"textFormat":0,"textStyle":""},{"children":[{"detail":0,"format":0,"mode":"normal","style":"","text":"而在这个问题上你有重大的误解。","type":"text","version":1}],"direction":null,"format":"","indent":0,"type":"paragraph","version":1,"textFormat":0,"textStyle":""},{"children":[{"detail":0,"format":0,"mode":"normal","style":"","text":"你误以为你必须把这些原料酿成顶级好酒才能交差、因为很显然父母在一车车往仓库里堆货的时候是这么期盼的。","type":"text","version":1}],"direction":null,"format":"","indent":0,"type":"paragraph","version":1,"textFormat":0,"textStyle":""},{"children":[{"detail":0,"format":0,"mode":"normal","style":"","text":"而且ta们尝了早期样品后抱怨你的成品味道不好，似乎暗示着ta们就是要那个顶级佳酿的结果。","type":"text","version":1}],"direction":null,"format":"","indent":0,"type":"paragraph","version":1,"textFormat":0,"textStyle":""},{"children":[{"detail":0,"format":0,"mode":"normal","style":"","text":"但这其实是一个误解。","type":"text","version":1}],"direction":null,"format":"","indent":0,"type":"paragraph","version":1,"textFormat":0,"textStyle":""},{"children":[{"detail":0,"format":0,"mode":"normal","style":"","text":"ta们真正的底线是只要酿出点东西就行。不需要是什么十大名酒，甚至不是酒都可以。","type":"text","version":1}],"direction":null,"format":"","indent":0,"type":"paragraph","version":1,"textFormat":0,"textStyle":""},{"children":[{"detail":0,"format":0,"mode":"normal","style":"","text":"你酿出一瓶醋，都行。","type":"text","version":1}],"direction":null,"format":"","indent":0,"type":"paragraph","version":1,"textFormat":0,"textStyle":""},{"children":[{"detail":0,"format":0,"mode":"normal","style":"","text":"只要你不拿去倒掉、烧掉，就算拿一整仓原料只酿成了一瓶醋，都行。","type":"text","version":1}],"direction":null,"format":"","indent":0,"type":"paragraph","version":1,"textFormat":0,"textStyle":""},{"children":[{"detail":0,"format":0,"mode":"normal","style":"","text":"这个“都行”是自然法核准的，你的父母私心可能一开始不满、“失望”，但","type":"text","version":1},{"detail":0,"format":1,"mode":"normal","style":"","text":"自然法至高无上","type":"text","version":1},{"detail":0,"format":0,"mode":"normal","style":"","text":"，容不得ta们不受，ta们最后总会放下自己的奢望、执念，学会知足常乐。","type":"text","version":1}],"direction":null,"format":"","indent":0,"type":"paragraph","version":1,"textFormat":0,"textStyle":""},{"children":[{"detail":0,"format":0,"mode":"normal","style":"","text":"你放心，人类就是这样被塑造出来的，喊价总是能喊多高喊多高，但是实际的心理底价就是“没酒，醋也行”。","type":"text","version":1}],"direction":null,"format":"","indent":0,"type":"paragraph","version":1,"textFormat":0,"textStyle":""},{"children":[{"detail":0,"format":0,"mode":"normal","style":"","text":"你要ta们一开始别把价喊那么高没用，ta们总要试一试，万一你真的能以这个价格成交呢？难道试都不试？","type":"text","version":1}],"direction":null,"format":"","indent":0,"type":"paragraph","version":1,"textFormat":0,"textStyle":""},{"children":[{"detail":0,"format":0,"mode":"normal","style":"","text":"但你放心，实际上你就算只交出一瓶醋，ta们最后纠结完了，最后还是会回到“有瓶醋也可以了”的心态立场上去，而且会最终走向知足常乐。","type":"text","version":1}],"direction":null,"format":"","indent":0,"type":"paragraph","version":1,"textFormat":0,"textStyle":""},{"children":[{"detail":0,"format":0,"mode":"normal","style":"","text":"你只是交易经验少，不懂这其中的道道，所以一听甲方的诈唬就压力过大了罢了。","type":"text","version":1}],"direction":null,"format":"","indent":0,"type":"paragraph","version":1,"textFormat":0,"textStyle":""},{"children":[{"detail":0,"format":0,"mode":"normal","style":"","text":"这不是在告诉你只需要交瓶醋就完事了，而是在告诉你，你还是要能酿出多好的酒就尽量尝试，只是你要把“拿不到博览会金奖就交不了差”的恐惧丢掉。","type":"text","version":1}],"direction":null,"format":"","indent":0,"type":"paragraph","version":1,"textFormat":0,"textStyle":""},{"children":[{"detail":0,"format":0,"mode":"normal","style":"","text":"其实你努力完只要有哪怕一瓶醋交、你都过关了。","type":"text","version":1}],"direction":null,"format":"","indent":0,"type":"paragraph","version":1,"textFormat":0,"textStyle":""},{"children":[{"detail":0,"format":0,"mode":"normal","style":"","text":"你过关的概率其实很高，根本就不难。","type":"text","version":1}],"direction":null,"format":"","indent":0,"type":"paragraph","version":1,"textFormat":0,"textStyle":""},{"children":[{"detail":0,"format":0,"mode":"normal","style":"","text":"所以根本也不需要走这个所谓的“我一把火烧了，你们也不用辛苦了”的路线。","type":"text","version":1}],"direction":null,"format":"","indent":0,"type":"paragraph","version":1,"textFormat":0,"textStyle":""},{"children":[{"detail":0,"format":0,"mode":"normal","style":"","text":"放心大胆的酿你的酒去，唯一的最大风险就是你老人家三天上房两天揭瓦纯瞎胡闹，实际上最常规的工序就保证了最后连瓶醋都没有的概率极低，根本没什么可担心的。","type":"text","version":1}],"direction":null,"format":"","indent":0,"type":"paragraph","version":1,"textFormat":0,"textStyle":""},{"children":[{"detail":0,"format":0,"mode":"normal","style":"","text":"最后你一开坛，常常酸掉眉毛——没事，直接命名为“紫琼贡酒”，弄个好点的酒标，告诉ta们限量珍藏、绝版供应，富含负离子抗氧化成分。","type":"text","version":1}],"direction":null,"format":"","indent":0,"type":"paragraph","version":1,"textFormat":0,"textStyle":""},{"children":[{"detail":0,"format":0,"mode":"normal","style":"","text":"保证二老巴巴的捧回去，逢年过节才拿出来喝一点高兴高兴。","type":"text","version":1}],"direction":null,"format":"","indent":0,"type":"paragraph","version":1,"textFormat":0,"textStyle":""},{"children":[{"detail":0,"format":0,"mode":"normal","style":"","text":"妥得很。","type":"text","version":1}],"direction":null,"format":"","indent":0,"type":"paragraph","version":1,"textFormat":0,"textStyle":""},{"children":[{"detail":0,"format":0,"mode":"normal","style":"","text":"你要是不信，你直接把这篇东西拿去给父母看，你看ta们点不点头。","type":"text","version":1}],"direction":null,"format":"","indent":0,"type":"paragraph","version":1,"textFormat":0,"textStyle":""},{"children":[{"detail":0,"format":0,"mode":"normal","style":"","text":"这就是阳谋。","type":"text","version":1}],"direction":null,"format":"","indent":0,"type":"paragraph","version":1,"textFormat":0,"textStyle":""},{"children":[{"detail":0,"format":0,"mode":"normal","style":"","text":"世界上最好交的货，就是父母找子女订的货，真是寄块砖头都会给你好评的那种买家。","type":"text","version":1}],"direction":null,"format":"","indent":0,"type":"paragraph","version":1,"textFormat":0,"textStyle":""},{"children":[{"detail":0,"format":0,"mode":"normal","style":"","text":"这你要都能搞砸，简直商业奇迹。","type":"text","version":1}],"direction":null,"format":"","indent":0,"type":"paragraph","version":1,"textFormat":0,"textStyle":""},{"children":[],"direction":null,"format":"","indent":0,"type":"paragraph","version":1,"textFormat":0,"textStyle":""}],"direction":null,"format":"","indent":0,"type":"root","version":1}}

brief:
@卢健龙 我不确定是什么原因，你似乎总是可以有效的绕开人的主要point——为什么你要避开“局部结晶和交联”不谈，把我的看法削弱成“高分子仅有单链”？言下之意，似乎我在没有拓扑学常识的主张“毛线”与“网”同胚？

你总在想象你的对手是白痴。

你要是没有足够的阅读理解能力，要格外
